<title>CANADA: Reuters second ex-Canada Air Cargo Market Report.</title>
<headline>Reuters second ex-Canada Air Cargo Market Report.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current average ex-Canada air cargo market rates per kg for 100kg shipment, with a volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one.</p>
<p>					 October 21	   July 15</p>
<p>				  ATLANTIC</p>
<p>     YYZ(Toronto)-LHR	    $1.30-1.50	   $1.30-1.50</p>
<p>     YYZ-CDG			 $1.30-1.50	   $1.30-1.50</p>
<p>     YYZ-FRA			 $1.30-1.50	   $1.30-1.50</p>
<p>     YUL(Montreal)-CDG	   $1.30-1.50	    unquoted</p>
<p>     YUL-LHR			 $1.30-1.50	   $1.30-1.50</p>
<p>				  PACIFIC</p>
<p>     YVR(Vancouver)-HKG	  $2.25-2.50	   $2.05-2.25</p>
<p>     YVR-NRT/KIX		   $2.75-2.85	   $2.72-2.85</p>
<p>* The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters</p>
<p>on a confidental basis from a range of Canadian market sources.</p>
<p>* All prices are quoted in Canadian dollars.</p>
<p>* The rates are indicative of current market activity.</p>
<p>* Does not include time of the week premiums or discounts.</p>
<p>- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
